{"site":"douban","sid":"1305216","imdb_id":"tt0050356","imdb_link":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0050356/","douban_link":"https://movie.douban.com/subject/1305216/","chinese_title":"海底喋血战","foreign_title":"The Enemy Below","year":"1957","aka":["水下敌人","海上追逐战"],"region":["美国"],"genre":["剧情","动作","惊悚","战争","冒险"],"language":["英语"],"playdate":["1957-12-25"],"episodes":"","duration":"98 分钟","description":"在二次大战期间的南大西洋，美国驱逐舰海恩斯号用雷达追踪到德国潜艇信号，于是穆勒舰长（罗伯特.米彻姆饰）便展开追击。穆勒原担任货轮船长，因被鱼雷击沉而转任海恩斯号的舰长，船上多是新兵。德国史登堡舰长（克德.朱尔吉斯饰）亦是船舰作战好手，奉命与奇袭舰会合并取回英国密码，故一直坚守航线，却遭穆勒识破尾随而来。穆勒深怕弹援不中而反遭德国舰队围击，便每小时以深水炸弹轰击以待援兵赶来。德国潜艇被逼到深海海床以便甩脱追击，由于美舰不断轰击使德军船员受不了，史舰长以进行曲鼓舞士气，这样一来更被美军声纳探知予以轰击。海恩斯号也受重创，穆勒假装弃船引诱德潜艇浮出海面，以便轰击潜艇使两舰相撞……","poster":"https://img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l_ratio_poster/public/p2181404066.jpg","douban_votes":"1318","douban_rating":"8.1","imdb_rating_average":"7.4","imdb_votes":"13324","imdb_rating":"7.4 / 10 from 13,324 users","director":[{"name":"迪克·鲍威尔 Dick Powell","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27246997/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img9.doubanio.com/view/personage/m/public/764bb06d979f0f47382d733ae3a6cff4.jpg"},{"name":"Arthur Lueker Arthur Lueker","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27327419/","role":"","avatar":"https://img1.doubanio.com/f/vendors/8dd0c794499fe925ae2ae89ee30cd225750457b4/pics/personage-default-medium.png"}],"writer":[{"name":"温德尔·梅斯 Wendell Mayes","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27216490/","role":"编剧 Writer","avatar":"https://img2.doubanio.com/view/personage/m/public/051345ef5713498e4d877245bbc62321.jpg"}],"cast":[{"name":"罗伯特·米彻姆 Robert Mitchum","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27232810/","role":"演员 Actor","avatar":"https://img9.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p1451216230.65.webp"},{"name":"库尔德·于尔根斯 Curd Jürgens","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27242535/","role":"演员 Actor","avatar":"https://img3.doubanio.com/view/personage/m/public/30e1784f63652e205d07b003d9ba579a.jpg"},{"name":"大卫·海迪生 David Hedison","link":"h